---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import checks from '../../../../../public/equipment/04-08/verification.json';
import m from '../../../../../public/equipment/04-08/interactions.json';
import {stations} from '../../../../lib/equipment/04-08/solver.mjs';
const a='/equipment/04-08/',spec='https://www.disco.co.jp/eg/products/grinder/dag810.html',photo='https://www.bridgetronic.com/cdn/shop/files/1-done-13_fcc10e95-c4ac-4568-a377-7f2e8144255d.jpg?crop=center&height=800&v=1737551197&width=800';
const display=x=>typeof x==='string'?x:Object.entries(x??{}).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+String(v)).join('; ');
---
<Layout pageTitle="DISCO DAG810 documentary view" subtitle="" description="Inspect a dormant DAG810 enclosure and read three detached geometric drawing dimensions." wide={true}>
<article id="dag" class="equipment"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/04-08/">← Equipment 04-08</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#dag-checks">Verification</a></nav>
<header><p class="eq-meta">04-08 / DISCO DAG810 / Closed documentary exterior</p><h2>DISCO DAG810</h2><p>Inspect the dormant enclosure, then read line spacing on a separate fixed drawing. The center witness measures 15 mm. Nothing changes the drawing or uses the machine.</p></header>
<div class="e-grid"><section class="e-card"><h3>01 · Inspect the closed case</h3><div id="dag-views" class="e-row">{['Bench','Front','Exterior','Desk'].map(k=><button type="button" data-view={k.toLowerCase()}>{k}</button>)}<button id="dag-xr" type="button" disabled>VR unavailable</button></div><canvas id="dag-model" aria-label="Orbitable closed DAG810 enclosure and separate inert drawing desk"></canvas><p id="dag-asset" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="e-hint">The three keys on the separate diagram desk select left, center or right. The machine enclosure is static. Drag to orbit, scroll or pinch to zoom.</p></section>
<section class="e-card"><h3>02 · Choose a drawing witness</h3><div class="e-fields"><label>Drawing station<select id="dag-station">{Object.entries(stations).map(([k,v])=><option value={k} selected={k==='center'}>{v.label}</option>)}</select></label></div><div class="e-row"><button id="dag-reset" type="button">Restore center</button><button id="dag-json" class="e-run" disabled>Export dimension JSON</button></div><p id="dag-status" role="status">No reading.</p><p id="dag-result" role="status">No spacing measured.</p></section></div>
<section class="e-card"><h3>03 · Read fixed drawing coordinates</h3><svg id="dag-diagram" viewBox="0 0 420 204" role="img" aria-label="Two reference drawing lines and three selectable vertical dimensions"><path d="M42 138L342 126M42 96L342 48" stroke="#315c6d" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/>{Object.entries(stations).map(([k,v])=><g data-station={k}><rect x={35+5*v.xMm} y={168-4*v.upperMm} width="14" height={4*(v.upperMm-v.lowerMm)} fill="transparent" stroke="none"/><path d={'M'+(42+5*v.xMm)+' '+(168-4*v.lowerMm)+'V'+(168-4*v.upperMm-5)} fill="none"/><circle cx={42+5*v.xMm} cy={168-4*v.lowerMm} r="3" fill="#315c6d"/><circle cx={42+5*v.xMm} cy={168-4*v.upperMm} r="3" fill="#315c6d"/></g>)}<text x="42" y="183" fill="#315c6d" font-size="14">Original dimension drawing · axes shown in mm</text></svg>
<p>Spacing is one subtraction, upper Y minus lower Y, from immutable coordinates. The line spacing is purely a dimension readout in an original drawing, not a physical shape or processing result. <a href={a+'example-spacing.json'}>Example JSON</a>.</p></section>
<section><h3>Documentary case geometry</h3><div class="e-grid"><figure><img src={a+'original-front.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original DAG810 enclosure and detached dimension desk"/><figcaption>Original silhouette informed by an <a href={photo}>external front photograph</a>. The diagram desk is invented and detached.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={a+'original-work.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original closed dark front glazing and cabinet"/><figcaption>Closed dark glazing and blank fascia, without interior contents or functional components.</figcaption></figure></div>
<p>The <a href={spec}>manufacturer’s DAG810 product page</a> documents the 600 × 1,700 × 1,780 mm nominal envelope. Panel shapes, trim and front pose are inferred. Nothing operates. The register’s material-change acceptance is outside this documentary pass.</p></section>
<section id="dag-checks"><h3>Verification and files</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(x=><tr><td>{x.id}</td><td>{display(x.expected)}</td><td>{display(x.actual)}</td><td>{x.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'reference-plan.json'}>Predeclared cases</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification data</a> · <a href={a+'disco-dag810.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'geometry-source.mjs'}>Editable geometry</a> + <a href={a+'make-model.mjs'}>generator</a> + <a href={a+'mesh-writer.mjs'}>mesh writer</a> · <a href={a+'interactions.json'}>Named targets</a>. {m.triangles.toLocaleString()} triangles and {m.draws} draw primitives; optional WebXR, physical headset untested.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/04-08/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
#dag header{max-width:73ch;padding:1.3rem 0}#dag h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:.2rem 0}#dag section{margin:1rem 0}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.e-card{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.e-card h3{margin:.3rem 0}.e-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.5rem 0}.e-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem}.e-fields label{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.e-fields input,#dag button{min-width:0;min-height:2.45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;padding:.3rem .5rem;box-sizing:border-box}#dag button:disabled{opacity:.52}.e-run{background:#3d596e!important;color:white!important}#dag-model{width:100%;height:clamp(280px,34vw,440px);display:block;background:#ebe8e0;touch-action:none}#dag-chart{width:100%;max-height:16rem}.e-over{overflow:auto}#dag table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}#dag td,#dag th{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#dag figure{margin:0}#dag img{width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:820px){.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.e-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
#dag caption{text-align:left}#dag input,#dag select,#dag button{min-width:0}#dag .e-hint{font-size:.92rem}#dag-diagram{width:min(100%,38rem);display:block;height:auto;background:#edeae0}#dag-diagram [data-station]{cursor:pointer;stroke:#8b9fa4;stroke-width:2}#dag-diagram .selected{stroke:#aa6a32;stroke-width:4}</style>
